	"nodes":[
		{"id":"f2a3b4c5d6e7f8a9","type":"group","x":1720,"y":0,"width":380,"height":1010,"color":"6","label":"LEGEND"},
		{"id":"e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2","type":"group","x":-20,"y":350,"width":1700,"height":40,"label":"LIFE AREAS  ↓  (each section = one topic filter on your vault)"},
		{"id":"a3b4c5d6e7f8a9b0","type":"text","text":"## 📐 Design Logic\n\n**This is 🏡Home redesigned.**\n_Not a new file — the existing Home\nnote becomes the Life HQ._\n\n---\n\n**Layout = Notion grid logic:**\n- Row 1: Time awareness\n  (Today · Focus · Actions)\n- Row 2: Life area sections\n  (Career · Health · Learning)\n- Row 3: Deeper context\n  (Personal · System)\n- Footer: Drill-down nav\n\n---\n\n**Tech stack (already installed):**\n- `Dataview` → live queries\n- `Commander` → action buttons\n- `QuickAdd` → capture flows\n- `Periodic Notes` → daily links\n- `Homepage` → opens this on start\n- `multi-column callout` → grid CSS\n\n---\n\n**Colors = vault palette:**\n🟣 Purple → Career/System\n🟠 Orange → Today/Time\n🟡 Yellow → Focus/Tools\n🟢 Green → Health\n🔵 Cyan → Learning\n🔴 Red → Personal/Goals\n\n---\n\n**What changes vs now:**\n✅ 🏡Home absorbs Dashboard\n✅ Single entry point\n✅ Drill-downs stay intact\n✅ No new plugins needed\n✅ Uses existing CSS snippets\n  (multi-column, wide-page)","x":1740,"y":20,"width":340,"height":970},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8","type":"text","text":"# 🏡 Life HQ\n> Single Obsidian starting point — **Productivity · Career · Health · Learning · Personal · Tools** — replaces scattered dashboards","x":0,"y":0,"width":1660,"height":90,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9","type":"text","text":"## 📅 Today\n**[[{date} | Open Daily Note]]**\n\n📌 Tasks due today `← Dataview`\n📆 Scheduled events this morning\n🌅 Morning intention (editable)\n\n> *Like Notion's \"Today\" linked database view*","x":0,"y":110,"width":540,"height":220,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0","type":"text","text":"## 🎯 Active Focus\n**Top 3 right now** — from 🔥 ON Efforts\n\n🚀 Effort A → 60% complete `← Dataview`\n🚀 Effort B → 30% complete\n⚠️ Overdue: X task\n\n> *Like Notion's filtered \"Active Projects\" view*","x":560,"y":110,"width":540,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1","type":"text","text":"## ⚡ Quick Actions\n```button\n📥 Capture   📝 Daily Note\n🚀 Project   📚 New Source\n💡 Atomic    🔁 Weekly Review\n```\n[[[⚡ Automation Menu#Action MENU#Capture|Automation menu]]\n*Commander ribbon · QuickAdd palette*\n*Ctrl shortcuts shown inline per button*\n\n> *Like Notion's \"New page\" quick-add buttons*","x":1120,"y":110,"width":540,"height":220,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3","type":"text","text":"## 🚀 Career & Productivity\n[[03-Efforts]] · [[05-Calendar/Sessions]]\n\n📋 Active efforts (status=active) `← Dataview`\n📊 Completion % per project\n🔴 Overdue tasks\n📁 Last AI session link\n\n**Tags:** #career #productivity\n\n> *Like Notion's Project Tracker database*","x":0,"y":410,"width":540,"height":280,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4","type":"text","text":"## 💪 Health\n[[Health MOC]] · [[Habits Map]]\n\n🏃 Habit streak this week `← Dataview`\n😴 Sleep · 🥗 Nutrition · ⚡ Energy log\n📈 Mood trend (last 7 days)\n🩺 Health notes added this month\n\n**Tags:** #health #habits\n\n> *Like Notion's Habit Tracker linked view*","x":560,"y":410,"width":540,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5","type":"text","text":"## 📚 Learning\n[[04-Sources]] · [[Learn MOC]] · [[IT MOC]]\n\n📖 Currently reading (status=reading) `← Dataview`\n🌱 New seedling notes this week\n📥 Processing queue (sources to read)\n🔗 Recent atomic notes created\n\n**Tags:** #learning #tools\n\n> *Like Notion's Reading List + Notes database*","x":1120,"y":410,"width":540,"height":280,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6","type":"text","text":"## 👤 Personal\n[[Life Map]] · [[People Map]] · [[Finance MOC]]\n\n🎯 Personal goals (effort type=personal) `← Dataview`\n👥 People to follow up with this week\n💰 Finance notes updated recently\n📓 Last journal / reflection entry\n\n**Tags:** #personal #career\n\n> *Like Notion's Life OS / Personal CRM section*","x":0,"y":710,"width":800,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d0e1f2a3b4c5d6e7","type":"text","text":"## 🛠️ Tools & System Health\n[[🧭 Review HQ]] · [[👁️Dashboard]]\n\n📥 Inbox: **{count}** unprocessed `← Dataview`\n🔗 Orphaned notes · broken links count\n📝 Notes modified today\n🔄 Last vault backup / git commit\n\n**Drill-downs →**\n[[🎮Gamification Dashboard|🎮 Game]] · [[📈Performance Metrics|📈 Metrics]] · [[🔍My PKM Queries|🔍 Queries]]\n\n> *Like Notion's System Health widget*","x":820,"y":710,"width":840,"height":220,"color":"3"},
